<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44814" root="&#xA;                        يمن&#xA;                    " body-key="Y1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اليَمِينُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>The location that is on the right.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَمِينٌ</span> also, The <i>south.</i> See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرْحٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَمِينُ</span> also
signifies <i>A covenant</i> (Bd, and Jel in lxviii. 39)
<i>confirmed by an oath.</i> (Bd, ibid.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَمِينُ ٱللّٰهِ</span>
                        <i>The oath by attestation of God:</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَيْمُ ٱللّٰهِ</span>,
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَهْدُ ٱللّٰهِ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلَفْتُ يَمِينًا</span> [<i>I swore,</i> or <i>have
sworn, an oath</i>]. (T, S, M, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمِينٌ</span>, which
see. You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَمِينَ ٱللّٰهِ لَا أَفْعلُ</span> (as in some
copies of the S [meaning, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلَفْتُ يَمِينَ ٱللّٰهِ</span>]): or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَمِينُ ٱللّٰهِ</span> (as in other copies [meaning, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَمِينُ</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ٱللّٰهِ قَسَمِى</span>]). See a similar form of oath voce
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرَامٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَمِينًا صَادِقَةً لَأَفْعَلَنَّ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعْمةٌ</span>.

